// "PowerAndToughness" = the arity-2 power-and-toughness building block
// ([CR#613.4] layer 7): DELEGATE-ONLY — no `template`, so it never stands
// alone as printed text. `PowerAndToughnessUp`/`PowerAndToughnessDown` are the
// parse surfaces; each forwards its own `Count` params into this macro's two
// `NumericOp` slots (`PowerAndToughness(Up(Param(0)), Up(Param(1)))`) — a
// nested-macro param-forwarding mechanism. A macro expands to ONE value, so
// the two axis ops bundle in a `Several`; `Modification::flatten` splices
// it away at the engine boundary.
(
    name: "PowerAndToughness",
    kinds: [Modification],
    params: [NumericOp, NumericOp],
    body: Several([Power(Param(0)), Toughness(Param(1))]),
)
